  "description": "Built for control and confidence on any terrain, the flat bar Hook EXT SX Eagle combines rugged performance with everyday versatility. Its double-butted chromoly frame features a tapered headtube and T47 bottom bracket for durability and responsive handling. Up front, a full carbon fork with triple cage mounts and internal hub dynamo routing boosts your bikepacking potential. The SRAM SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain with an 11–50T cassette and 38T chainring mounted to a Rival wide chainset delivers a wide gear range while keeping an efficient road q-factor. Rolling on tubeless-ready WTB ST Light i25/i23 rims and WTB Ranger TCS Light tires, this flat bar setup gives you off-road traction with on-road agility—ready for whatever path you choose.",
